    array (
      'text' => 'A burst pipe causes two kinds of damage: the water in your home and the water on your bill. If you\'re a Cobb County Water System customer, the county\'s leak credit policy can take a partial bite out of that bill, as long as you meet the rules and keep the right paperwork. Here\'s how it works and what to save from the day the leak starts.',
