        'kind' => 'para',
        'text' => 'The leak credit is for leaks on your private plumbing, meaning your side of the meter. Leaks on the public system are the county\'s to repair. If you see water bubbling in the street or at the meter box and suspect the public line, call Cobb County Water System Emergency Dispatch at 770-419-6201.',
