        'kind' => 'h2',
        'text' => 'Vacant lake homes during high water',
      ),
      17 => 
      array (
        'kind' => 'para',
        'text' => 'Second homes along the lake are at extra risk, because nobody is there to notice water coming in. A neighbor check, a leak sensor with phone alerts and a working sump with a backup pump can catch a problem before it becomes a full lower-level flood. See Lake Allatoona water damage restoration',
        'links' => 
