        'text' => 'After the water: dry it fast',
      ),
      19 => 
      array (
        'kind' => 'para',
        'text' => 'If water got into your basement, mold can start within 24 to 48 hours on wet drywall, carpet and wood. Outside water is treated as contaminated, so carpet, pad and lower drywall are usually removed and everything is sanitized before drying. See flooded basement cleanup in Acworth',
